  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e0ee1537899cb864d00d338b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛中盘一段时间内向前突进",
      "source_fingerprint": "993899e2726057ef348c87de2ad711bca71baada64ea831147e04b0aad08f3ef",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "410011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:20eee6e9c1f262f74c928928",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "直线上速度大幅提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "62f1f6bcf3d68f64ec3207becf32e8e3c7cf8bed63dd2c5d33ed0ff7df9c71ca",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "410021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:06a11cb2da3c2b450d961aba",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛中盘速度大幅提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "7fe9bf86e6a632680314449cf388c31e94e7cb5d77a95355ef2f8c232f6bdbbe",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "410031"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2bc912806170de2dad0ea58f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "起跑时加速度提升\\n之后在最终冲刺的关键时刻\\n稍微向前突进＜作战・领放＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "92aceb9f38f255f1be3601af2cd4005221c471477dae01669a176aada629c8dc",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "410041"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4c9e28eed6a98093dc12cb81",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在终盘的最终弯道位于队伍中间往前时\\n若距离终点尚远则提升加速度\\n之后在最终直线上稍微向前突进＜先行/差行＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "cc87a5b5a5a26d390ae323822d1c9034558c24b20ad4cd6f4236ec29b1158af6",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "410051"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7e8234667b67a2eca075285e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "临近比赛终盘时\\n若位于中后方则速度提升\\n之后在最终冲刺的关键时刻\\n稍微向前突进＜作战・追赶＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "18256dbce2b8975c80d94045c98cf10787daf11cb31d15a43aa1cd9d8ca9e24a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "410061"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1c9731e69d2a0f3ab1fb23f3",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛中盘速度大幅提升\\n＜中距离/长距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "1229a3e31f42fa53f28ee26a8baf85d6956b7c14419ee9e8d14e53ab55aafc7f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "411011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0e0ca2bf6ac1e6e9b911edfe",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛中盘一段时间内速度提升\\n＜中距离/长距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "3c08a13dc89e8f223181a448fbedfb03728063174d2dcc2dffb1ca7ad90f625c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "411021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:83d717104542545e313d0e13",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛中盘的弯道一段时间内\\n速度少量提升,之后在最终直线\\n稍微向前突击＜中距离/长距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "e7d1d50c62c188258335347f046a9faf870dce85b501e22abacb98f8006d08ee",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "411031"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e5198d27fcc2cb75a54e53f1",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "最终冲刺的关键时刻\\n速度大幅提升＜中距离/长距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "9dec8fb1c82a79835d3af18909e7c2a03e99b10a9fa994ecd1010e55b14fee72",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "411041"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a51bdacd46d9e14c5fb9d2d5",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛中盘位于中后方时\\n速度大幅提升＜中距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "e4ba61ab2e9b297f93d8c979a5cc43bf02085c8dbcaaf68c166274f64b95cd62",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "411051"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4e3a55f229c3b24b1b24e5de",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛中盘位于中间往前的位置时\\n速度大幅提升＜中距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "86f9c19ae4335d2921d335689a9285d735efd5f5df0ca11e66b61b788d6debd8",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "411061"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d74b84b2869836f2ad22fc4e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "正后方长时间有赛马娘时\\n速度会大幅提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "883c4fab2e4d4485dfbbc748f984d6f796409fe6b2c535a3170531576ba21c32",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "412011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f301b98f5138e7e535c6a726",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "起跑时加速力会提升\\n之后在比赛中盘\\n速度会小幅提升＜作战·领放＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "28a049af489f8d7a02445284586df2c61aeea4050c6c0e80ee9afeffea801db2",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "412021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d33e204c17f3896e62d63917",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛序盘或中盘\\n被超越或进行竞争时\\n会大幅向前冲出＜作战·先行＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "f108211c3d66fb2bca94f5c286c09f228976166cbb777da13869bbdb58de5ccf",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "412031"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e2206a7dc706eb3fa46c721e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛中盘速度会大幅提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "530101fd3ee185a1a74a6c5b1a0ecdc2879bb1521cd14b89e8e337012c7a6d02",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "412041"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f920d022120e32cce02a1be7",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛中盘的一段时间内速度会提升\\n＜居中/后追＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "37c6581e8dc1bb9ed49c261fc1401c5b33661bda49b8ff59bd2ec8412cdc54a5",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "412051"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ebee963e8c63fbe1c17254cd",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "紧跟在前方赛马娘身后\n或处于领头位置且后方紧跟赛马娘的状态\n持续较长时间时，速度大幅提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "08798d5ccf502444fe92bbe2954394228915dd5056ec7f7d6829e14aa8c53a78",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "413011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1ec901e3415b1519c57effb2",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛中盘进行超越或处于领头位置时\n速度提升。之后在最终盘的前段\n若正处于最后冲刺阶段，则速度稍微提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "eeb4a9b17d4f7e0327c4be1d446176c86cb6961b5a3578d4d1ccf124f5bf9342",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "413021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0e53eaf99d7a00c618e7a25c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛中盘，一段时间内速度提升\n＜沙土＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "43d7f7c596e17d3045defd3616761bb3843148a07b6d6465e0ca02462ad96edc",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "413031"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:99e4d14241fd9f15b97fe553",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛最终盘的前段\n若正处于最后冲刺阶段则\n速度大幅提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "d777a8bfc8855e3ceaeb85fa91e7dcd2fc34c272b8f4c03568688e8e12f4416a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "413041"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ff82bbc55d725c8840049654",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛中盘，速度大幅提升\n＜中距离/长距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "3875642c89d5a568c1965fa4ae465e76256f1f830810fc30d9131712153430cf",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "413051"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d7e086833e88c22c288aec4b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "若紧随其后的赛马娘保持较长时间\\n则速度大幅提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "d8bd3c97e9f46152d9d1fdb5f713e6339d8319074d407994b0d2fa90f188caa1",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "414011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2188c407573a9d5db723222a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛中盘开始时大幅回复耐力\\n并稍微向前突进\\n＜中距离/长距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "8c72ae3c15332e3e717ca6c34b3d1c89080630bffb15f0ff115a4bac7aaa4df0",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "414021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:293d92f34a5bf3bc1ae98494",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛中盘一段时间内速度提升\\n＜中距离/长距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "3c08a13dc89e8f223181a448fbedfb03728063174d2dcc2dffb1ca7ad90f625c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "414031"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e0c2edbf39efe55f8cd909a3",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛中盘速度大幅提升\\n在中距离比赛中若所有基础能力\\n都足够高则效果改变\\n变为极大幅度向前突进",
      "source_fingerprint": "2dad96d8e06c18a34be3633977b1b8c8ba53f20f7751fe472860b4f54e193d67",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "414041"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d368508780923508c90ef7cf",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛中盘位于前方时\\n速度大幅提升＜英里＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "f925b4c9f309147e6bd9b7901d3f48a8d63465b88b5235af652396a47f89b604",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "414051"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:097c6a3d81ef3ea9d870a716",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛最终阶段开始时\\n若处于最后冲刺中\\n则速度大幅提升＜英里＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "e12e9f313f597b490d594bd9a19bf30f7777933e216df84170345ca8d32cbec5",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "414061"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6458854941856c2172cb3755",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛终盘身处前方并完成超越时\\n能稍微向前突进\\n并且极少量提升加速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "2bce4f234c08ec9b9464f3b72e09ae2be7fd51e13297555ebc468088858cbc2b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "900011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4886ca15a7953ce4d74c2108",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛中后半段位于第一并拉开差距时\\n提升速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "fa0ad3b2fb24a92d54b84edb673c6e96ef421bfc391a9e694d04352658da7fef",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "900021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e7f059dd874ee7482e127da2",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "若是在比赛终盘缩短与前方对手的差距\\n则在最终直线上小幅提升速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "96d30d56583c326eea591b4597fa5ff7d5e6f0ee22bcbf1f11d09f2871cc2bda",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "900031"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6eaa358c074fa3d10a2c816f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "最终弯道后处于前列时\\n略微提升加速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "fef6e2ebbf8853f6b07d3c1bc76edb96accc8edf9d3168168b6c4f6c5d477bc4",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "900041"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b961203c16b22f7ebddea213",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛终盘位于前列并突围时\\n在距终点300米时稍微提升速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "c9d03b2b80ea0117505b856fdb39038dfe549d19b6dd3a80457ecaeee2bce057",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "900051"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9f08713b7c88e27139045589",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在最后200米处于前列时\\n能够开辟道路,略微容易突围",
      "source_fingerprint": "697df8c68b2f8cd6cee35afc3e8ccf2771e460554f2c3f95475e15ae43159c1d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "900061"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:76b97ef92ec8d2185242a91a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "从比赛中段进行长距离冲刺,速度会一点点加快",
      "source_fingerprint": "08bd5d6276a049f31f4dbe70425fa1e4dc6e613a3b4a3fc614e2f6ca1ad43c8f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "900071"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:62db3e891dc28cc99b8c9271",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在最后200米处于前列进行名次争夺时\\n竞争力变强,速度也会略微加快",
      "source_fingerprint": "000221a8338cf9b9956fa31752362684f84d9e402ccfaa06e16d24774fe45fd2",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "900081"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:744eff0011a7e3a104f82397",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛后半段身处前方的话\\n能发挥让自身成为第一的力量\\n提升速度和加速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "ee204f18900c491fb2edf71eab6a5d2e68ca34ef0f9af7a8134c25990347cbca",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "900091"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b180a2898172e7cce348a960",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "最终弯道后半处于好位置时会增加动力\\n稍微持续提升加速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "175b6aab5123edeaddd87539e9ceb52cc7698a6c4ce72fee42912f4dd568cafd",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "900101"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7ac057ea96ae4c80dff35104",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在最终直线上从后方赶超时\\n会略微加快速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "9b099dc733397acdd9b99428560756f1b7700512b95dbf59b36ad3c77063db72",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "900111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6fb0c6af138d6fa9e6587bfc",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "最终弯道之后从后方绕到外道\\n并且完成赶超时\\n在最终直线上加快速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "0756622ebd68d1c9da205d3f575ebd0916c1e1f0116ae8c5814e5a8c511ddc67",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "900121"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a7ef4fdafefd4af2d0031a89",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "最终弯道前身处前方时\\n速度稍微提升。如果身处长距离比赛\\n且体力充沛,则速度提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "5632d43998dd9c56fe8fce461cf38c1341bfa29f4b4ba624452c43f800bbfc86",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "900131"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0df57e4582420973959a1b2d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在最终直线上仍保有余力且处于前列时\\n更容易保持优势",
      "source_fingerprint": "ea70da9300d31994bc9b7c502a619d078ec678062580c5abf87e7c723dad26ea",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "900141"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a9636ab078115c59dd939575",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在最终弯道之后身处前列\\n并且与前后的赛马娘距离较近时\\n能够稍微提升速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "573f6e1d9471649c2c798b3a3ad135128162b4e47529fc74108097b160d60bd1",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "900151"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4e561e3e4a3be40d1dd2b89b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在最终弯道之后在外道完成赶超时\\n以怪物般的力量稍微提升速度\\n若在中盘争夺过名次,变为少量提升速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "a872c8c2b1668695c4a8c310ca9746c8eb25a0dbedf87381e024c69b60e56dd1",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "900161"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3bb89938e9487b99df883429",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛终盘赶超3次后\\n最终直线上会少量加速",
      "source_fingerprint": "ec1aac799fde576d2b101b03d061b039aa0d3dc48d59b582b66605e43cbfd92f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "900171"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f13cd285171a13cfb342e939",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在最终弯道从中后方赶超时\\n速度稍微加快",
      "source_fingerprint": "385992aa63400c65c7fee33350ca221927d630a8e352492f19a4779dad6ad10a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "900181"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:411c2a361ce841276940380c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛终盘2次赶超的话\\n能够加快速度\\n且路线选择变得更明智",
      "source_fingerprint": "cb80d8169d39715fa305d620c8666513a475840d237a97636a5db7e15e22f7f5",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "900191"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c56c6b79aca02c3a0399ddff",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛终盘的弯道上处于第一位时\\n稍微提升加速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "6bc2f02806c205719d3b53c9aa3e4bdfac2269a6e89dcbba0e37d3b1988e8f66",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "900201"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:31c8e1b27f7afa316ab3c9e2",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在赛程后半段直线若处在好位置\\n或由中间梯队向前冲击时\\n稍微提升速度与加速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "ee1bdbbbbff4093c929c7d343136ad9b18b69364e568b74970a0f4b2c95c38d7",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "900211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2b2381bb02d213ba6aaed8e7",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在赛程后半若处于好位置并进行名次争夺时\\n稍微提升速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "6999255f16e6821bb54456f0e2ce59eac8144c9b699f1544ba380491dbeec505",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "900221"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8ad02966d7a82ff07bef17fc",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在终盘的最终弯道前位于前方时\\n速度稍微提升。如果比赛全程保持冷静\\n则变为速度小幅提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "8745eec1d759c0035687ab92f61faa578839a3ff4cdb757d17c057c058c1dbd7",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "900231"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:218dba6d8ddaa5f664369824",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "最终弯道之后处于前列进行名次争夺时\\n在直线上稍微更容易突围",
      "source_fingerprint": "f504e48013dde3e3e2d84fd9a7d093e1363599cca9dde344a0518fc8fba5aa59",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "900241"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3de161d790daf407aace7843",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "赛程后半时\\n由中间梯队稍微提升速度\\n使前方的马娘稍微萎缩",
      "source_fingerprint": "d83a8577a50389f4550be45ee8d9d6d0a6016af04db08535b2624f1395870ee1",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "900251"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:628687ad4124372bb09cdda6",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在没有起步晚的情况下,最终直线上位于前方时\\n速度稍微提升。若是一直保持在靠前位置的话\\n改为速度小幅提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "4f3a6a38c46a025e879f58e48d42aabc35e3d82548742a1c0444fdbb5e7da657",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "900261"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b532e1275ce48191cde031a0",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛终盘的弯道中想要冲向前列时\\n略微提升加速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "ccc3737c46284579d4cb4c23cb08fa3a8926265fb2f46307ef03443a09564500",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "900271"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7c99ee813a8db76a0d56990b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "若比赛的中段处于好位置准备超越时\\n速度略微提升\\n若是短距离比赛\\n则效果改为略微向前突进",
      "source_fingerprint": "a1b59bc2d2293574c852ed3d50beabfd3b45ae1fc6f8312b061dd2e26d07ba93",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "900281"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:09b9e4d18f1dca29277a09b0",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "最后300米处在前方\\n且与最前方的马娘距离很近或是领头时\\n速度略微提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "e5c6200d1f28b6b5d619bf60aabccd2938aad70dae13df07c843c075ec939547",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "900291"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c55fb58949cb1ace163be8b1",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛终盘完成超越\\n并身处前方集团的话\\n在最终直线上稍微提升速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "b118c96b40435a584383648ddd9bd85593139b1e16d8fe4c76c6e8988fc3cab0",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "900301"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:56a5891a5b387c8baa7ce89d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "剩余300m左右处于前方的话略微提高速度\\n若刚好上完坡\\n则速度稍微提高",
      "source_fingerprint": "95f3a7b2ecc32d50d6f2a1fac911f1542da4bb55f7820155c652aaff27e8c1a6",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "900311"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7422967610d227f25bc23a9a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛后半且靠近弯道时\\n稍微恢复持久力\\n且短时间内略微提高速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "e3c020a5267014d20d8b61ab7963d52c6eb851dbbb29909d44f3fec56228f6a9",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "900321"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:40e392318ba08d9cb3bc262c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "最终直线上若与先头集团拉开了距离\\n则会稍微提升速度\\n若身处最后方,提升更多速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "6b982562769b1b0659e5328486bbcd15de5bad78c25a184f41efea6cf207afb3",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "900331"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ceddb828ef85b8d94759f951",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛前半,一直位于队伍中后方等待时机的话\\n在名次争夺时,将稍微提高速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "590bac92f5d2501ac0c79b9f7cec582a03ddee97bb2b790d993e3d5f4c0fecbc",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "900341"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0f4afbba1a5f4554755df37b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "最终弯道之后进行名次争夺,在最终直线位于前方时\\n稍微提升速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "784ebd86f19aa257574c781e9a1b3a224954b081d12d34aa580d29e785ea652b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "900351"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:921e1dd2ef06103177db3d3d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "最终弯道之后若处于队伍中部靠近内埒的一侧\\n则会在最终直线上略微提高速度\\n略微容易取得好路线",
      "source_fingerprint": "0d117f53f05ccf8eeb6bb96d89763bbeeaf745cc559bf6aa968c4f19544ae07d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "900361"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d0c92a80fca7063422f48f13",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "冷静地进行比赛,并在最终直线上\\n位于第三名以后的话,速度稍微提升\\n若是长时间处于中间集团,改为小幅提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "a74994077fe8025e184dd9eb7a62b6c901c4598edf364fbbb8d559147b2259c0",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "900371"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9b362c6b315aa1b9d0fb052c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛中段左右并处于好位置完成赶超时\\n稍微提升速度与加速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "bf5b67fffb3c6e3549566b4d1c2ea59185eb766b9d030de165133ff7819dafef",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "900381"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4e3c0ecb815bac89bc3aaab7",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在最终直线进行名次争夺时\\n稍微提升速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "47fadaad1bdbd4c1867b3c10f7bb298636cda1c3e7cb01775f57e273dc80f14c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "900391"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f92f3b373a6aae530d28e074",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛后半程从队伍中团开始加速追赶前方时\\n速度会持续微量提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "4138d9b60f4eb52614403bae84c340b69b8964bfaab0564afc44bc9e0df5c092",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "900401"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:54678a8abd1a346e7394f49e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛后半段处于前列进行名次争夺时\\n速度略微加快",
      "source_fingerprint": "ba351a2c2ecf21e8b5f4293d7074239cd4069c27ef228f364fdaac0e3a31efc1",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "900411"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:61303daed55a875f72cbe9a3",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛剩余200m处自身不在领头位置\\n距离领头4马身以内时速度微量提升\\n距离2马身以内时速度少量提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "7cbf5e80c87ef259577b9d696a1b49bc41f9c1c93a09cf011c6c8bc76dfedb6b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "900421"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3650067c5c31bd09559e47be",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "名次争夺时,速度提高一点\\n若是身处沙土比赛\\n加速度会稍微上升",
      "source_fingerprint": "cef9445010a7296cd82e8d651bffe52fa484722b6d9edb38b87a3aa4115bf831",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "900431"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f53a6360d11d33995b37a546",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "进入最终弯道前能一直保持冷静\\n在后方等待机会的话,会在\\n距离终点剩余300m处略微持续提高速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "8f0250c917321884eb315940974b7f033ece469552b63a1ce85baa117043accc",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "900441"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:711740b6ae470b5b1ffc2fc5",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛中盘处于好位置时\\n持久力回复",
      "source_fingerprint": "6e840da6f513589eb3f91d109657894e66fbd62c08de278830ffa1e9337503bd",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "900451"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:21e9a63268e78a6b8e894028",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛中盘的直线位于前方\\n并被后面的马娘拉近距离时\\n绝不让步的想法将会稍微化作动力",
      "source_fingerprint": "9107d18709137f425e323c118eaa4b0bfdfb046ad3491586a2270d3ecefd16f7",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "900461"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c51d114e57f69f55aee8954b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛终盘阶段剩余400m处位于前方时\\n速度略微提升,且在GⅠ比赛\\n等大舞台上取得高人气时,速度少量提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "1ce84e7e25f7224e6d0315ed303c25f4c855f8b15e54e75de6be54e4634df7f8",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "900471"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:51ad8b63927a42c98e9665ea",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "最终直线上身处前方\\n完成超越或是即将被超越时\\n速度稍微提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "4f7bee98cedb5241f30c44a9c5c8c91cb9e80821bd62a1085241ece84e962e30",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "900481"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:17e4bd14300fa1dafba541d8",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "最终弯道之后准备超越前方马娘时\\n将在剩余400m以后的好位置处稍微提高速度\\n人气较低的时候速度提升稍多",
      "source_fingerprint": "79251654c6857b7cdc6fbbc253fcd6e2ce6321d073ac162d32e405d07212a2f0",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "900491"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:470bfe23713b78410dafedda",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "最终弯道之后从中间梯队向前突进时\\n稍微加快速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "ac334a99ee88b6402db9ff62f1b78b0a8458ec98bd77f183b6369914580638aa",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "900501"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:13a76cf4ad7db9ef0996449c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "中盘经过弯道竞争\\n且终盘的最终弯道过半后自身占据好位置时\\n稍微提升加速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "65d18b4f50b6a419f82c9a7562eae1883a3b733a8b0f16ad2ba99f04d2316d53",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "900511"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f473b0f0b252cb3301dd062e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在最终弯道处于靠后位置时\\n会看着附近的赛马娘并略微恢复持久力",
      "source_fingerprint": "d13127a133d1b1e74e2582b72021f50ac6f75c3240c4d248b951c2921daaf015",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "900521"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
